{"title": "Sapping Curse (Condition)", "pageid": 19253, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sapping_Curse_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spirit Guardians Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Sapping Curse</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><i>This cursed energy drains vitality of anyone who dares get closer.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Any creature within range of the affected entity gains the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vitality_Drain_(Condition)\" title=\"Vitality Drain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vitality Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Spirit_Guardians_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vitality_Drain_(Condition)\" title=\"Vitality Drain (Condition)\">Vitality Drain</a>, and takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">4d6+4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> per turn. Take half damage on succeeding <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;8 Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;8 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li>\n<li>Target is cursed. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_(status_group)\" title=\"Cursed (status group)\">Cursed</a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_CA